Technics SX-KN5000 floppy disks.

The KN5000's factory "Initial Data" set (idd5000) plus style, wallpaper and demo
library disks.  Each is available as a self-extracting PC archive that writes its
payload onto a blank FAT12 HD diskette (1.44 MB); who prepared or distributed the
